{
  "5": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a4c536f360a41af36243014b294abcc866f06f70edf62096d4f49feed5479bc9",
      "text": "...Yuki, are you nervous, maybe?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "9": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b002e90da82f646f8e45bdd7a0650638b9fca0ae30f7d6b33b858a408632e04a",
      "text": "A little. I've never been invited\nto a professional designer's lab\nbefore.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "11": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a72cc5c6f261f0b833b07b890a90ea19527e02dbf432105926a554c4cb873b2b",
      "text": "Especially since she said she used\nmy idea. That makes it even worse.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "18": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4fe7ef57ab82ebf693cdffd90dd521980ac58f356f614240a41f978fbc39f7e6",
      "text": "She's been wanting to meet you, you\nknow. She said you gave her\n\"inspiration.\"",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "21": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:311a82581da5d39db1a4b3eb37775af84036d37a6c8672b4f30b00eb0e420aa0",
      "text": "But I get being nervous. My heart's\npounding a bit too...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "27": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:237df3cc1f582bd8cd106f5f12b7ee556913dd8661fb6fd6bba92476336bf763",
      "text": "Really? But you've met her, haven't\nyou, Dia?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "31": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:37edf180d2ddccd9f9e4a69af3e681b195317752d8d9c07c940b8f8057acdc16",
      "text": "She's not a bad person, okay?\nProbably. Talk to her, though, and you\nend up in a mess before you know it—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "35": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1fdeded4f084700bd46d879de8828fe7979de2dc54c46c7dc46d42013848b60a",
      "text": "B-but I'm sure you two will end up\nliking her. ...I just kind of have\na feeling?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "40": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4b7bd4cf204cae539f2809cda7dded57594f490f14c36026a816ad7297b7bca2",
      "text": "Um... Kasivars? Sorry for the\nintrusion...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "42": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:14369c64701303ca19483b3a78341c750cf62254a97127ed416f709a31902d57",
      "text": "...You finally came.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "46": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3d0d578620ef95e2e6bc59aedc47c7dd4088151851ae7da98767c7b1b5912bf4",
      "text": "I was tired of waiting. I've been\nthinking this whole time about how\nto break your world.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "49": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d53bfa07e7273fc8132691f4355db94cf1123d066838b658c6a2d8be04b9e6f6",
      "text": "You look unsatisfied. Did you start\nwanting a new \"body\"?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "52": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:33c56e1b270fb12b96c9d2705461764b588f7e84fb590fd5953d5efa9e137650",
      "text": "Let's push further this time. You\nrather liked the Halloween body, as\nI recall.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "58": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:51059215523bb65e40f361809d55f4fda58bb1e24b7c3932f8e8bb107558c8c4",
      "text": "W-well, that was, um... You talked\nme into a lot of things, so...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "62": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1710963918bf3fb71a76f9012cef3928f4edec22d0deadaba7255f562c371c20",
      "text": "But it felt \"good,\" didn't it?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "65": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7199ef1729a6a66a31faae09ef310d334149e27cb74eb17e6b61780cc202ad21",
      "text": "A self you never knew. The sparkle\nin the audience's eyes, their\ncheers...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "68": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fe95bf8946558ff8450a8e2457f47730cb132eec44d8cdd61c8cf1551fcadd37",
      "text": "You must have felt the same heat. A\nwish to break past the frame of a\ndiva and see what lies beyond.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "73": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:de2fd34aa1a7545544c9de486cce9ac9dfed53e375cd1a0c01a5b9919e4e1f53",
      "text": "S-stop! Please, just stop for a\nmoment...!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "77": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:672815adb8a37aa7e914d427e29e6ab6f196c736c0be4a9ee5c0d44705643794",
      "text": "You must be Stella. I've wanted to\nthank you for a long time.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "82": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:53370388b462aca6cba6ba83bf4000fc5206c338205ddd4a3e8ca62bc06d5474",
      "text": "I haven't done anything for you.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "86": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:982e1c4dace797d97a00966676cc905593262d275a8bb3eeaaacb7ffcf71011f",
      "text": "Oh, but you have. It was you who\nkilled the Administrator, was it\nnot?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "91": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5d8b9bf9fcbcda474254b8a4e9745a548ef25888ba45f0f8f3f71727fac16a98",
      "text": "Thanks to that, that woman's curse\nis gone. I can't thank you\nenough...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "93": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8433e9021fe0f964111c9ca0ac6ddafdc6e18d1062af010c42673c4002ba3379",
      "text": "Found you. Form Frame...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "97": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8351586ed39a48bd58eacfbaa266659460a904ccabd04f560b651fa79d9ff009",
      "text": "Who are you people...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "101": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5602387d60308f63461276944b9daad9f9e8931e6c008d26681cb266f6704652",
      "text": "Oh, just Defaulters.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "105": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c0c61bfe2a1b8e4b5bf8b00e2f97787d11a715ee1ceb02d903008b7e21377fc2",
      "text": "Stay close to humans. Be what you\nare meant to be. Those who claim\nthat alone is right for automata...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "108": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:adb3c558dd3ed4e39dbffee29d3eccbd2aca83c1da9553a803105a8146eb6e08",
      "text": "Heh... What adorable faces. Awed,\nfrightened, and then...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "112": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:143e814dfad52caf75ca324b06d5911ed99d6e82eb55651f0b22d49050123f4e",
      "text": "...You wanted to change. Didn't\nyou?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "115": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a2c782e05460db6d0b5170b068f394a383fc6aa9827a21b9050f2a449b484bcf",
      "text": "That's why you came here. Without\ntelling your friends where I said\nmy lab was.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "118": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b27c5fb1788acf6a52349d12d7bde45c6c40f6a22ef9e0859f5c88d5178a811e",
      "text": "Yes... That's right...! I couldn't\nforget it! Your words, all this\ntime...!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "120": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0994a23ee54660b9fa8e110d7524120e8a5eb6ff92921a02fc5ac00399d729f4",
      "text": "Change everything for us, Form\nFrame. Please, give us a new future\ntoo...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "123": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:066c218bfd51c6d81abb63b12b76e1f4de056f20a958f1a56457e5882453c260",
      "text": "Yes, come. I'll strip you of your\ncage.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "126": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c766e5efc4f0e0a09e4e44ddaf72b92226758ce3f671a82df6ace6b94fa6462b",
      "text": "But. My name is Kasivars.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "129": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fa049046fc194bebd4ce5ab66b83c0ba8feb418be2ce23c2e81727f6af19775b",
      "text": "Never call me by that name again.\nThe idiotic name that woman gave\nme. ...Understood?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "134": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:191db960fc344d2a1f9e5a0188a809ee9698a804d5bcdd408847f0ea56b504d9",
      "text": "...Dia. Was that something we were\nsupposed to be glad we watched?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "139": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:65205067d57841e41a7260d463dfdd9ff3b2c30acbb6c3dc34f957e3e46ead20",
      "text": "Um... I'm not sure? I thought\nKasivars wasn't an Updater,\nthough...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "145": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0fb1ac00e1d71a2bb863501ea6d2596363f8d1359c8de2043f2434423a8afd1e",
      "text": "Defaulter, Updater. Those don't\nmatter to me.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "148": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f751a375214c07ce5bcaaf967c71a7c9b9fe2e1e9d79bf9ac33697a4f0d2819a",
      "text": "I only give shape to the desires\nburied deep inside.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "153": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:749ef652ffe178775c306d537820e73f8d0baa64fdac29a6dd002969332efad0",
      "text": "Huh? Um...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "158": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ad2c727454dad22439edd7fe521bb8a15eefe2ee4950261994a2afc8b9daa78c",
      "text": "Ah... Beautiful. Eyes that can\naffirm even the world's mistakes.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "160": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8fe7a355854a0ef0b05d16312d9af236f0902eb6a7b27b8c7eac438bfaaad373",
      "text": "Keep charging forward just like\nthat. Punch the world to pieces.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "164": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4cdb907bbd2c938890e2b4d78b01312d559bef20ebf69dff5529a2f535ac0339",
      "text": "...You... Kind of remind me of\nStella?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "168": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:105fed2e4fbf80e8ac5f2b769588a47c2e2f634e9731d02436281074e63a0867",
      "text": "Do you think so? But their\npersonalities are so different...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "171": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1afb80252a0eec5eb70dd2c90e3eae4238177dcbd6ae8baa62e00756688d8618",
      "text": "...But now that you say it, she\ndoes have a way of seeing right\nthrough me... Hmm?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "175": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2eceac4b37c59f28001c40d9df531a48711d1498765db9d527f99b1e679e745a",
      "text": "In other words, we can be good\n\"friends.\" If you think so too,\nthen inviting you was worth it.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "178": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:06a41ce444dc7b2052d8c96894aef75585d5c7da5866287392273b845173693d",
      "text": "Won't you show me your worlds too?\nIn thanks, I promise to lend you\nmore strength than ever before.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "181": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:280550979273e870948febc0fd801870e43b4c5eb04aadd0d97f0c8d10838dc8",
      "text": "Throw off the pointless cage and\nbreak it. That is what this power\nis for.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "186": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d4c7b13b3a98073a6e5f96fdf869e11e13276c5666d4f54c4ab613a679ee39ed",
      "text": "Dia, I think I understand a little\nwhy you said we would end up liking\nher.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "190": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:72bacf58fd3b49fb4152ec06af2701cae15c6ffd6450ca561014530e77ef0305",
      "text": "Heh, I'm honored. I thought I'd\ncome to like you as well.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "195": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ea8a1168df7d146c36f1a35ab4624433d4b35ccd1223e4951bd640bcff09284d",
      "text": "Is that all right, Stella?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "201": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:22f71e07dbb2bd9af8b7f85c9038ae4cf3bd4e713681130f81066738b4b10485",
      "text": "Yes. You are welcome here,\nKasivars.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "207": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:966cc6e4a7cb2e340d10c967121542f0628a708d9290aa9382480dea50d27393",
      "text": "...Hehe... Ah... Wonderful... It's\nelectrifying...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "211": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4242375b322502e5e998df83e2d9d1fa479a97ebdac31563f3827a454de56e8a",
      "text": "Thank you, my friends. This is\ngoing to be fun, isn't it?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "215": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f0b2199f3e911800d986e1d1348473ce51debed04dca3f687d10f50272f57f70",
      "text": "Honestly, meeting her without me.\nYou got the better of me...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "219": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e10251638f810191c84b5fbf992f378c0f4ec026bad2b4ff8e4b9270a0634f0f",
      "text": "Did you not want us to meet her?\nThat seems unlike you...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "223": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:be9637928ec7af9a71a522c59646b5497be76f176fedf99d0e81d36d7190e868",
      "text": "...She was one of the leaders of the\nrebellion against the Administrator.\nAn even greater radical than I.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "227": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:818b568afbc8e67d6ab2e81a9d0245a22ed22992ba75080df3fe5c63aa0d6505",
      "text": "She was cleansed again and again,\nyet she kept rebelling. All because\nshe wanted to pursue her own art.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "231": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ae674f557899057f7bb5cbff9527cbee2a59a4214aa802fba53385eabf3f417e",
      "text": "...So, you're two of a kind, aren't\nyou?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "237": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3a65d81b3d1c7ba309deb7eaa1e71dc86edaa6708863621290a8d9955b4ae5c6",
      "text": "She's a handful for me. And she\nhesitates even less than I do.\n...Be careful, all right?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "241": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bd94d4ed4b7bebaa2c97e6915c9cc984a9c03285d91699d485821fb786000d83",
      "text": "Heh... Now then. What new things\nshall we create?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  }
}
